{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>She is a niddah.</b> Because she is analogous to a niddah: sometimes a niddah is forbidden and sometimes she is permitted; so too a brother's wife — sometimes she is forbidden and sometimes she is permitted, by means of levirate marriage, when she is widowed without seed."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:50.293791178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}